    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Want to swing it around at some of those tall patches of grass to get
        some <style=item>plant fiber</style>? We'll need 3 pieces to make a <style=item>rope</style>
        to attach the <style=item>rusty axe head</style> to the <style=item>makeshift
        handle</style>.
