      Data: RopeCraftingTutorial
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: To craft a <style=Item>rope</style>, you'll need <style=Item>3 plant
        fibers</style>. Open up your <style=TutorialHint>inventory</style> <icon=Action_Inventory>,
        then check the recipe book there to find the recipe for <style=Item>rope</style>
        and follow the instructions!
