    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: To craft the <style=Item>rusty axe</style>, put the <style=Item>makeshift
        handle</style> on the bottom, the <style=Item>rope</style> in the middle,
        and the <style=Item>rusty axe head</style> on top.
