    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I've helped tinker <style=Caladin>Caladin</style> test a few of these
        that he repaired a while back. We'll need some <style=item>planks</style>,
        an <style=item>iron bar</style>, and a couple pieces of <style=item>rope</style>.
