    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: You can use your <style=item>rusty axe</style> to chop down the smaller
        dead trees around here to get some <style=item>wood</style>. Then, check
        your recipe book for the <style=item>plank</style> recipe to make all we
        need for the bounce pad.
