    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I've planned out the bounce pad we can use to get up this cliff, but
        I'll need you to gather some <style=item>wood</style> and <style=item>plant
        fiber</style> with that <style=item>rusty axe</style> you made earlier.
