    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: I've seen <style=Caladin>Caladin</style>, our town tinkerer, craft some
        tools before. I'm not very handy myself, but maybe you can give it a try?
        Let me teach you...
    - Name: <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField
